! doubtful glyphs).  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 11D11MCP
! CARD ID 0B000326  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 251" (round glyphs
! in numeric fields read 0); the heading row's LOCATION field is
! 230157, line 1's word.
!
! THE PAGE.  56 lines, contiguous from 230157.40 to 230223.00 (a half
! word; next location 230223.40, where printed p.252 opens).  Lines 7,
! 16 and 50 (CNOP,) print no location: each follows a row that ends on
! a full word, so the CNOP emits nothing.  Every line number prints a
! "*" after it (lines 1-56).  Asterisks after the LOCATION on lines 15,
! 19, 41 and 53.  No remarks.  Line 15's DD prints no binary (32
! characters = 4 words, 230170.00 .. 230173.40).  The DRZs (lines 19,
! 53) print their size, 000002.00 words each, and get no !CHECK (as
! p.214's DRZs).
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * line 4 label "RENCTR" = RENDTR (D with a worn stem): line 9
!     B,RENDTR prints 230161.50 = this row's 230161.40.
!   * line 6 "REJJCB" = REJJOB (open O), as every landed deck spells it
!     (230364.0); BBZ .59 prints 230364.73.
!   * line 13 label "RCCUNT" = RCOUNT (open O), as other pages
!     SYN it at 230166.40 = this row.
!   * line 15 "(IQS*)DC(BU)" = DD (worn D), as the landed (IQS*)DD(BU)
!     message cards; label RCMSGE (M worn) as other pages' SYNs spell it, 230170.00.
!   * line 43 binary prints "290234.77": the second digit is a blotted
!     3 (no 9 in octal); same statement as line 29 (230234.77).
!   * lines 12, 14, 51, 52 "VF,C", "XW,C", "BE,C" = 0 (binary all 0).
!   * hex bytes "C0"/"CO" = 00, "C1" = 01, "DO"/"D0" = D0 (SVA), "FC"
!     = F0 (line 31 h2), "DC" = D0 (lines 1, 5 h2); octal "C" = 0.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  Right-hand serials run 0B000326 .. 0B000360, none
